&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0&quot; data-edge=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BitGo is the leading infrastructure provider of digital asset solutions, delivering custody, wallets, staking, trading, financing, and settlement services from regulated cold storage. Since our founding in 2013, we have focused on enabling our clients to securely navigate the digital asset space. With a global presence and multiple Trust companies, BitGo serves thousands of institutions, including many of the industry&#39;s top brands, exchanges, and platforms, and millions of retail investors worldwide. As the operational backbone of the digital economy, BitGo handles a significant portion of Bitcoin network transactions and is the largest independent digital asset custodian, and staking provider, in the world. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.bitgo.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Onboarding Associate, you will be responsible for reviewing account openings, conducting due diligence checks, and providing advice to various business functions. Your main objective will be to ensure compliance with internal policies and AML/KYC requirements, while also identifying opportunities for onboarding process improvement to mitigate compliance risks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will support our APAC onboarding requirements and reports to the CEO/Director of Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Conduct client due diligence (CDD) and enhanced due diligence (ECDD) in accordance with internal policies, procedures and regulatory guidelines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Conduct periodic review based on KYC/KYB CDD guidelines, ensuring timely updates and escalations where required;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide high-quality customer service by owning, monitoring, and improving customer service, handling customer inquiries, managing communications with customers throughout the entire onboarding process;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work closely with internal teams to ensure a cohesive approach to customer onboarding and account administration;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Participate in internal and external training programs related to AML/CFT and other subjects that may form part of the day to day work requirements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Handle ad-hoc tasks assigned by the supervisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Minimum bachelor&#39;s degree holder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Minimum of 1–3 years of experience in a relevant compliance, onboarding, due diligence role, preferably within the financial services or fintech sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Good understanding of the Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) PSN02 Guidelines, Notice and related laws, directives, regulations and compliance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with emerging virtual currency regulatory frameworks in other jurisdictions is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, communication and documentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in both English and Mandarin, with the ability to review and assess documents in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BitGo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disrupting an industry takes vision, innovation, passion, technical chops, drive to deliver, collaboration, and execution. Join a team of great people who strive for excellence and personify our corporate values of ownership, craftsmanship, and open communication. We are looking for new colleagues who bring innovative ways of thinking and problem solving, and who want risks to be part of the team that changes the world’s financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are some of the benefits of working at BitGo:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary, bonus, and stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer equipment to suit your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great colleagues and inspiring startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BitGo is the leading infrastructure provider of digital asset solutions, delivering custody, wallets, staking, trading, financing, and settlement services from regulated cold storage. Since our founding in 2013, we have focused on enabling our clients to securely navigate the digital asset space. With a global presence and multiple Trust companies, BitGo serves thousands of institutions, including many of the industry&#39;s top brands, exchanges, and platforms, and millions of retail investors worldwide. As the operational backbone of the digital economy, BitGo handles a significant portion of Bitcoin network transactions and is the largest independent digital asset custodian, and staking provider, in the world. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.bitgo.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BitGo is the leader in digital asset financial services, providing institutional investors with liquidity, custody, and security solutions. Founded in 2013, BitGo pioneered the multi-signature wallet and is the first digital asset company to focus exclusively on serving institutional clients.&amp;nbsp; Active in both centralized and decentralized finance, BitGo offers market leading trading, lending, and borrowing services through its prime brokerage services and acts as the custodian for WBTC, the leading global stablecoin for Bitcoin. In 2020, BitGo launched BitGo Portfolio and Tax, providing clients with a full-stack solution for digital assets. In 2018, it launched BitGo Trust Company, the first qualified custodian purpose-built for storing digital assets. BitGo processes approximately 20% of all global Bitcoin transactions, and supports over 600 coins and tokens. BitGo provides the security and operational backbone for more than 1500 institutional clients in 50 countries, including many regulated entities and the world’s top cryptocurrency exchanges and platforms.&amp;nbsp; BitGo is backed by Goldman Sachs, Craft Ventures, Digital Currency Group, DRW, Galaxy Digital Ventures, Redpoint Ventures, and Valor Equity Partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The BitGo Prime team is a dynamic, high performing group that provides critical operational service to our institutional trading, lending, and borrowing clients in partnership with our Trust custody and compliance entity; global account managers and salespeople; and finance and accounting. Our extended unit consists of a diverse group of trading, lending, and KYC/AML professionals with extensive backgrounds in traditional and crypto-finance, including front, middle, and back office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Prime Client Services Associate will be responsible for managing business operations for BitGo Prime’s digital asset trading and financing services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage BitGo Prime’s trade and settlement workflows including trade entry, asset transfers, reporting and reconciliation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Prime’s business team to maintain optimal funding across various trading venues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First line of support for trading or financing operations related enquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead process improvements, identify gaps, recommend improvements and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing efforts for all enhancements of proprietary systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce daily, weekly and monthly reporting for internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Sales and Client Services team with on-boarding new counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying operational risks, introduce operational controls and document policies &amp;amp; procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the product/engineering team to improve our products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain relationships with clients, exchanges, liquidity providers and third party providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date about market trends, opportunities, risks and new projects, with a passion for the digital asset industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BitGo is looking for people who are passionate about their craft, take full ownership for their work and projects, and believe in transparent and collaborative culture with the goal of making BitGo successful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incredible attention to detail and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to effectively interact with others in a pleasant, professional manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to understand assets flows and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have previous middle or back-office experience in a financial services Trading, stock loan, FX experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and interacting with clients is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortably manage competing priorities in a fast-moving, dynamic start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Excel or Google Sheets experience; macro programming exposure is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in financial services and cryptocurrency; crypto experience professionally or personally is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree from an accredited university, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BitGo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disrupting an industry takes vision, innovation, passion, technical chops, drive to deliver, collaboration, and execution. Join a team of great people who strive for excellence and personify our corporate values of ownership, craftsmanship, and open communication. We are looking for new colleagues who bring innovative ways of thinking and problem solving, and who want risks to be part of the team that changes the world’s financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cryptocurrencies are the most disruptive change the financial services industry has seen in years. Join us and you’ll be able to look back and say you were part of the team that transformed investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BitGo is the leading infrastructure provider of digital asset solutions, delivering custody, wallets, staking, trading, financing, and settlement services from regulated cold storage. Since our founding in 2013, we have focused on enabling our clients to securely navigate the digital asset space. With a global presence and multiple Trust companies, BitGo serves thousands of institutions, including many of the industry&#39;s top brands, exchanges, and platforms, and millions of retail investors worldwide. As the operational backbone of the digital economy, BitGo handles a significant portion of Bitcoin network transactions and is the largest independent digital asset custodian, and staking provider, in the world. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.bitgo.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role will require being full-time onsite at our San Francisco office to support collaborative team dynamics and innovative problem-solving.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Product Marketing Manager to drive go-to-market strategy across BitGo’s platform. This role will work across multiple product lines, including custody, wallets, APIs, and emerging retail and mobile experiences, helping define how we bring products to market and scale adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate at the intersection of Product, Marketing, Sales, and Design, ensuring our products are clearly positioned, effectively launched, and widely adopted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own messaging, positioning, and GTM strategy for key BitGo products and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep understanding of customer segments across institutional and retail audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build buyer personas, use cases, and competitive positioning to differentiate BitGo in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Launch Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management to shape roadmap priorities and bring new features to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product launches end-to-end, including internal alignment, messaging, and external campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own release communications and ensure adoption across existing and new clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create sales collateral including decks, product guides, demos, and customer-facing materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Sales and BD teams with the messaging and tools needed to close deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather insights from Sales to continuously refine positioning and improve conversion rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with content, growth, and PR teams to drive demand and awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support campaigns, lifecycle marketing, and product-led growth initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape BitGo’s narrative across channels including web, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail &amp;amp; Mobile (Emerging Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GTM efforts for BitGo’s retail and mobile platform initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help translate institutional-grade infrastructure into intuitive, user-friendly messaging for retail audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and design teams to improve onboarding, engagement, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 to 7 years of product marketing experience in fintech, SaaS, crypto, startup, or financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate technical products into clear customer value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching products and working cross-functionally with Product, Sales, and Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with both institutional and retail user journeys is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing, storytelling, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, proactive, and comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BitGo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disrupting an industry takes vision, innovation, passion, technical chops, drive to deliver, collaboration, and execution. Join a team of great people who strive for excellence and personify our corporate values of ownership, craftsmanship, and open communication. We are looking for colleagues who want to help build the infrastructure powering the future of finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary, bonus, and stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% company-paid health insurance for employee, partner, and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 4% 401k company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave, Paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free commuter/parking pass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free custom lunches, dinners, and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer equipment and workplace furniture to suit your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great colleagues and an inspiring startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits may vary based on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending upon your leveling and location, the compensation for this role averages between $130,000 and $150,000 USD base salary. Equity, an annual performance bonus, and the benefits outlined above are also part of this role’s package.&lt;/p&gt;

